cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this tool in your work, please cite it."
title: "challenge-data-checker: audit ML benchmarking train/test splits for chemical data leakage"
abstract: >-
  A command-line tool and Python API that audits machine learning benchmarking
  datasets (train/test splits) for chemical data leakage, duplicates, and data
  quality issues, using RDKit for structure canonicalisation and similarity
  comparison.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "OpenADMET"
  - name: "Open Molecular Software Foundation"
repository-code: "https://github.com/OpenADMET/challenge-data-checker"
url: "https://github.com/OpenADMET/challenge-data-checker"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - cheminformatics
  - data leakage
  - benchmarking
  - machine learning
  - ADMET
  - RDKit
